<title>NEW ZEALAND: Bank of NZ lowers NZ mortgage rate to 9.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of NZ lowers NZ mortgage rate to 9.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of New Zealand said late on Tuesday it was cutting its New Zealand floating mortgage rate to 9.95 percent from 10.15 percent. The bank said all other rates were under review and announcements would be made. --Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
